Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.45,Doc,,0,0,0,,More than ten thousand dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.50,0:00:04.99,Doc,,0,0,0,,That's how much you can now save\Non one brand-new ute in Australia,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.04,0:00:06.79,Doc,,0,0,0,,compared with its old list price.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.84,0:00:07.87,Doc,,0,0,0,,Not a used car.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.92,0:00:10.49,Doc,,0,0,0,,Not a demo with forty\Nthousand kilometres on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.54,0:00:13.41,Doc,,0,0,0,,A new ute, from one of the\Nbiggest car brands in the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.46,0:00:14.95,Doc,,0,0,0,,And the reason is brutal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.00,0:00:16.35,Doc,,0,0,0,,Before this ute launched,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.40,0:00:19.47,Doc,,0,0,0,,the brand was talking about selling\Ntwenty thousand in its first year in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.52,0:00:20.12,Doc,,0,0,0,,Australia.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.17,0:00:24.47,Doc,,0,0,0,,Fifteen months after launch, it had\Nsold fewer than eight thousand in total.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.52,0:00:25.85,Doc,,0,0,0,,It's not the only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.90,0:00:29.67,Doc,,0,0,0,,Right now, you can buy a brand-new\Ncar for under twenty thousand dollars
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.72,0:00:30.13,Doc,,0,0,0,,drive-away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.18,0:00:33.91,Doc,,0,0,0,,Toyota a brand that almost never discounts\Nis offering four thousand dollars
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.96,0:00:35.45,Doc,,0,0,0,,on the HiLux.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.50,0:00:37.65,Doc,,0,0,0,,Ford is offering five\Nthousand on the Ranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.70,0:00:41.47,Doc,,0,0,0,,And Black Friday deals are landing on\Ncars that used to have waiting lists.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.52,0:00:42.47,Doc,,0,0,0,,So in this video,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.52,0:00:45.99,Doc,,0,0,0,,I'm counting down the ten biggest\Nnew-car deals in Australia right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.04,0:00:47.81,Doc,,0,0,0,,from smallest to biggest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.86,0:00:50.65,Doc,,0,0,0,,Real offers, from the brands\Nand the motoring press,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.70,0:00:53.55,Doc,,0,0,0,,with the prices, the end\Ndates and the catches,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.60,0:00:56.47,Doc,,0,0,0,,because almost every one\Nof these deals has one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.52,0:00:57.47,Doc,,0,0,0,,Stay to the end,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.52,0:01:00.65,Doc,,0,0,0,,because number one is the deal that tells\Nyou the most about where this market
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.70,0:01:01.50,Doc,,0,0,0,,is heading.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.05,0:01:04.38,Doc,,0,0,0,,First, why is this happening now?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.43,0:01:10.42,Doc,,0,0,0,,Australians bought 107,493\Nnew vehicles in October 2026,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.47,0:01:11.76,Doc,,0,0,0,,a record for the month.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.81,0:01:12.94,Doc,,0,0,0,,So people are buying.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.99,0:01:15.86,Doc,,0,0,0,,But they're buying very different\Ncars from even a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.91,0:01:20.54,Doc,,0,0,0,,Electric car sales were up 237\Nper cent on October last year,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.59,0:01:23.44,Doc,,0,0,0,,BYD sold more than ten thousand\Ncars in a single month,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.49,0:01:26.38,Doc,,0,0,0,,and cars built in China\Nwere up 104 per cent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.43,0:01:30.08,Doc,,0,0,0,,That means a lot of brands are sitting\Non stock they can't move especially
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.13,0:01:33.04,Doc,,0,0,0,,utes, big SUVs and older models.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.09,0:01:35.57,Doc,,0,0,0,,Mitsubishi sales were down\N50 per cent in October.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.62,0:01:37.72,Doc,,0,0,0,,Renault was down 58 per cent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.77,0:01:40.04,Doc,,0,0,0,,Hyundai was down almost 29.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.09,0:01:43.76,Doc,,0,0,0,,Even Ford, the maker of Australia's\Nfavourite ute, was down 3 per cent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.81,0:01:45.30,Doc,,0,0,0,,And there's a second pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.35,0:01:46.68,Doc,,0,0,0,,It's the end of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.73,0:01:48.40,Doc,,0,0,0,,Dealers have annual targets,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.45,0:01:53.56,Doc,,0,0,0,,factories want to clear 2025 and 2026-built\Ncars before the new plates arrive,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.61,0:01:56.10,Doc,,0,0,0,,and Black Friday falls\Non the 27th of November.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.15,0:01:59.68,Doc,,0,0,0,,So brands are throwing\Neverything at buyers price cuts,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.73,0:02:04.90,Doc,,0,0,0,,cashback, fuel cards, deposit contributions,\Ngift cards and free servicing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.95,0:02:06.62,Doc,,0,0,0,,A quick note before we start.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.67,0:02:10.06,Doc,,0,0,0,,These deals are current\Nas of mid-November 2026.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.11,0:02:12.44,Doc,,0,0,0,,Most of them end on the 30th of November,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.49,0:02:15.78,Doc,,0,0,0,,the 21st of December or\Nthe 31st of December.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.83,0:02:17.98,Doc,,0,0,0,,Drive-away prices can change by state,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.03,0:02:20.42,Doc,,0,0,0,,and some deals are only\Nfor private buyers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.47,0:02:22.88,Doc,,0,0,0,,So always get the final price\Nin writing from the dealer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.93,0:02:24.09,Doc,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.88,0:02:27.41,Doc,,0,0,0,,Number ten: the fuel card war.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.46,0:02:32.05,Doc,,0,0,0,,Some brands don't want to cut the\Nprice, because that hurts resale values.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.10,0:02:34.31,Doc,,0,0,0,,So instead, they hand you a fuel card.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.36,0:02:38.19,Doc,,0,0,0,,Chery is offering a two-thousand-dollar\Nfuel card on the Tiggo 7,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.24,0:02:43.11,Doc,,0,0,0,,with the Tiggo 7 Urban\Nat $29,990 drive-away,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.16,0:02:46.07,Doc,,0,0,0,,and a fifteen-hundred-dollar\Nfuel card on the Tiggo 4,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.12,0:02:49.73,Doc,,0,0,0,,which starts at $23,990 drive-away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.78,0:02:54.25,Doc,,0,0,0,,The Chery E5 electric SUV gets two\Nthousand dollars cashback instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.30,0:02:57.09,Doc,,0,0,0,,Those offers run until\Nthe 21st of December,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.14,0:02:59.33,Doc,,0,0,0,,according to the deals tracker CarSorted.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.38,0:03:01.41,Doc,,0,0,0,,Mitsubishi is doing the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.46,0:03:04.15,Doc,,0,0,0,,There's a three-thousand-dollar\Nfuel card on the Triton ute,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.20,0:03:07.81,Doc,,0,0,0,,and a two-thousand-dollar fuel card\Non the Outlander LS Black Edition,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.86,0:03:13.97,Doc,,0,0,0,,which is listed at $47,990\Ndrive-away until the end of November.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.02,0:03:16.13,Doc,,0,0,0,,Now, here's the catch with fuel cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.18,0:03:19.33,Doc,,0,0,0,,A two-thousand-dollar fuel card is not\Nthe same as two thousand dollars off
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.38,0:03:19.73,Doc,,0,0,0,,the price.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.78,0:03:21.99,Doc,,0,0,0,,You can't spend it on anything else,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.04,0:03:25.25,Doc,,0,0,0,,it doesn't reduce your loan, and\Nit doesn't reduce the stamp duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.30,0:03:26.89,Doc,,0,0,0,,If a dealer offers you a fuel card,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.94,0:03:30.61,Doc,,0,0,0,,it's always worth asking: could I\Nhave that as a discount instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.66,0:03:31.95,Doc,,0,0,0,,Sometimes the answer is yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.00,0:03:33.85,Doc,,0,0,0,,And remember the context.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.90,0:03:36.15,Doc,,0,0,0,,Mitsubishi's sales halved in October.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.20,0:03:38.03,Doc,,0,0,0,,When a brand's sales fall that far,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.08,0:03:41.16,Doc,,0,0,0,,there's usually more room to\Nnegotiate than the advertised offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.78,0:03:43.86,Doc,,0,0,0,,Number nine: Honda's plate clearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.91,0:03:47.70,Doc,,0,0,0,,Honda sells its cars at fixed,\Nno-haggle prices in Australia.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.75,0:03:50.94,Doc,,0,0,0,,So instead of cutting the price,\Nit's giving away gift cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.99,0:03:53.92,Doc,,0,0,0,,Its end-of-year plate clearance,\Nreported by CarExpert,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.97,0:03:58.84,Doc,,0,0,0,,runs until the 31st of January\N2027 on 2026-built cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.89,0:04:00.58,Doc,,0,0,0,,The biggest gift card is\Nthree thousand dollars,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.63,0:04:06.22,Doc,,0,0,0,,on the CR-V e:HEV X hybrid\Nand the ZR-V e:HEV X hybrid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.27,0:04:09.98,Doc,,0,0,0,,Other CR-V and ZR-V hybrids\Nget fifteen hundred dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.03,0:04:14.52,Doc,,0,0,0,,And the Civic, the HR-V, the Prelude\Nand the Accord get a thousand dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.57,0:04:15.66,Doc,,0,0,0,,On top of that,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.71,0:04:19.26,Doc,,0,0,0,,Honda is throwing in the first five\Nscheduled services for free that's five
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.31,0:04:21.40,Doc,,0,0,0,,years or fifty thousand kilometres.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.45,0:04:25.16,Doc,,0,0,0,,CarExpert valued that at $1,395.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.21,0:04:26.70,Doc,,0,0,0,,So on the best-value models,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.75,0:04:29.68,Doc,,0,0,0,,you're looking at around four\Nthousand dollars in total benefits.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.73,0:04:31.92,Doc,,0,0,0,,Not bad from a brand that\Nalmost never does deals.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.97,0:04:33.64,Doc,,0,0,0,,Here's the catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.69,0:04:39.58,Doc,,0,0,0,,Honda's annual service price has\Njust gone up, from $199 to $279.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.63,0:04:43.18,Doc,,0,0,0,,So that free servicing is worth\Nmore than it was a month ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.23,0:04:46.98,Doc,,0,0,0,,And remember, the gift card arrives\Nwithin thirty days of delivery it doesn't
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.03,0:04:48.90,Doc,,0,0,0,,come off the price you pay on the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.95,0:04:50.52,Doc,,0,0,0,,And if you're thinking about the Accord,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.57,0:04:52.52,Doc,,0,0,0,,it was the number one\Ncar in my last video,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.57,0:04:55.15,Doc,,0,0,0,,with just fifty-nine sold in nine months.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.86,0:04:57.54,Doc,,0,0,0,,Number eight: GWM.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.59,0:05:00.36,Doc,,0,0,0,,GWM is a Chinese brand,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.41,0:05:03.84,Doc,,0,0,0,,but it's not riding the\NChinese boom like BYD or Geely.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.89,0:05:06.96,Doc,,0,0,0,,In October, GWM's sales\Nwere basically flat,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.01,0:05:11.56,Doc,,0,0,0,,down 0.3 per cent the only Chinese brand\Nin the top ten that went backwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.61,0:05:13.38,Doc,,0,0,0,,And it's responding with deals.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.43,0:05:15.16,Doc,,0,0,0,,According to GWM's own offers,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.21,0:05:16.80,Doc,,0,0,0,,listed by CarSorted,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.85,0:05:21.86,Doc,,0,0,0,,the Haval Jolion Premium\NHybrid is $32,990 drive-away,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.91,0:05:24.38,Doc,,0,0,0,,with a three-thousand-dollar\Ndeposit contribution.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.43,0:05:29.80,Doc,,0,0,0,,The bigger Haval H6 Ultra\NHybrid is $43,990 drive-away,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.85,0:05:32.56,Doc,,0,0,0,,also with three thousand\Ndollars towards your deposit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.61,0:05:38.18,Doc,,0,0,0,,The H6 Lux petrol is $35,990\Ndrive-away with two thousand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.23,0:05:42.32,Doc,,0,0,0,,And the Cannon ute is\Nfrom $39,990 drive-away,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.37,0:05:44.72,Doc,,0,0,0,,with a smaller\Nfive-hundred-dollar contribution.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.77,0:05:47.06,Doc,,0,0,0,,All of those run until\Nthe 30th of November.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.11,0:05:47.94,Doc,,0,0,0,,Back in October,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.99,0:05:53.26,Doc,,0,0,0,,CarExpert reported GWM offering up to\Nfive thousand dollars off selected SUVs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.31,0:05:55.36,Doc,,0,0,0,,So this brand is clearly in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.41,0:05:56.18,Doc,,0,0,0,,The catch?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.23,0:05:58.82,Doc,,0,0,0,,A deposit contribution is\Neffectively a discount,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.87,0:06:01.98,Doc,,0,0,0,,but it's usually tied to\Nfinance or to specific stock.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.03,0:06:04.84,Doc,,0,0,0,,And remember, these deals\Nchange month to month.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.89,0:06:06.40,Doc,,0,0,0,,If you miss the end of November,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.45,0:06:09.44,Doc,,0,0,0,,there's a good chance another deal\Nturns up in December but there's no
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.49,0:06:11.37,Doc,,0,0,0,,guarantee it will be the same one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.19,0:06:14.78,Doc,,0,0,0,,Number seven: the Toyota HiLux.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.83,0:06:15.88,Doc,,0,0,0,,This one is rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.93,0:06:17.66,Doc,,0,0,0,,Toyota doesn't need to discount much,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.71,0:06:20.90,Doc,,0,0,0,,because Toyota sells more\Ncars than anyone in Australia.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.95,0:06:24.28,Doc,,0,0,0,,In October, the HiLux was the\Nbest-selling vehicle in the country,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.33,0:06:27.16,Doc,,0,0,0,,with 5,954 sales.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.21,0:06:29.32,Doc,,0,0,0,,But the ute market is getting crowded.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.37,0:06:30.86,Doc,,0,0,0,,So according to CarExpert,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.91,0:06:35.27,Doc,,0,0,0,,Toyota is offering a four-thousand-dollar\Nfinance deposit bonus on HiLux SR5
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.32,0:06:39.72,Doc,,0,0,0,,four-by-four dual-cab pickups and\Ncab-chassis models diesel only.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.77,0:06:40.69,Doc,,0,0,0,,With the bonus,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.74,0:06:46.86,Doc,,0,0,0,,CarExpert says the effective prices\Nbefore on-road costs are $59,990 for
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.91,0:06:48.88,Doc,,0,0,0,,the manual dual-cab pickup,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.93,0:06:52.06,Doc,,0,0,0,,$60,490 for the automatic cab-chassis,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.11,0:06:56.48,Doc,,0,0,0,,and $61,990 for the\Nautomatic dual-cab pickup.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.53,0:06:58.94,Doc,,0,0,0,,Now, here's the catch and it's a big one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.99,0:07:01.70,Doc,,0,0,0,,You have to finance the\Ncar through Toyota Finance,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.75,0:07:04.20,Doc,,0,0,0,,and you have to borrow at\Nleast ten thousand dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.25,0:07:05.30,Doc,,0,0,0,,Leases don't count.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.35,0:07:07.66,Doc,,0,0,0,,And the electric HiLux isn't included.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.71,0:07:11.66,Doc,,0,0,0,,You'll need to order and apply for\Nfinance by the 31st of December,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.71,0:07:13.72,Doc,,0,0,0,,with settlement by the end of February.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.77,0:07:17.02,Doc,,0,0,0,,So if you were going to pay cash,\Nthis deal isn't really for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.07,0:07:18.92,Doc,,0,0,0,,But if you were going to finance anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.97,0:07:21.24,Doc,,0,0,0,,compare Toyota's interest\Nrate with your bank's.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.29,0:07:24.70,Doc,,0,0,0,,A four-thousand-dollar bonus can\Ndisappear quickly if the interest rate is
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.75,0:07:25.55,Doc,,0,0,0,,higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.02,0:07:29.55,Doc,,0,0,0,,Number six: BYD's\Nfour-thousand-dollar cashback.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.60,0:07:33.81,Doc,,0,0,0,,BYD is the second biggest brand in the\Ncountry and it's growing like crazy up
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.86,0:07:36.51,Doc,,0,0,0,,153 per cent in October.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.56,0:07:38.27,Doc,,0,0,0,,So why is it offering cashback?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.32,0:07:39.63,Doc,,0,0,0,,Because it's in a price war,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.68,0:07:42.27,Doc,,0,0,0,,and it wants to keep the\Npressure on everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.32,0:07:43.87,Doc,,0,0,0,,According to CarExpert,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.92,0:07:47.77,Doc,,0,0,0,,BYD is offering four thousand\Ndollars cashback on the Seal 6,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.82,0:07:52.69,Doc,,0,0,0,,the Shark 6 ute and the\NSealion 5, 6, 7 and 8 SUVs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.74,0:07:53.79,Doc,,0,0,0,,With the cashback,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.84,0:08:00.13,Doc,,0,0,0,,the Sealion 5 Essential works out\Nat $29,990 before on-road costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.18,0:08:04.09,Doc,,0,0,0,,The Sealion 7 Premium one of the\Nbest-selling electric cars in the country
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.14,0:08:06.69,Doc,,0,0,0,,works out at $50,990.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.74,0:08:11.43,Doc,,0,0,0,,And the Shark 6 Premium\Nplug-in hybrid ute is $53,900.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.48,0:08:15.79,Doc,,0,0,0,,There's also 0.99 per cent finance\Nover thirty-six months on most of those
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.84,0:08:16.32,Doc,,0,0,0,,models.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.37,0:08:18.97,Doc,,0,0,0,,Orders have to be placed\Nby the 21st of December,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.02,0:08:21.17,Doc,,0,0,0,,with delivery by the end of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.22,0:08:21.89,Doc,,0,0,0,,The catch?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.94,0:08:24.39,Doc,,0,0,0,,The cashback can't be combined\Nwith other BYD offers,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.44,0:08:28.07,Doc,,0,0,0,,it's not for fleet buyers, and\Ndemonstrators aren't included.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.12,0:08:31.63,Doc,,0,0,0,,And Zecar reported claims that some\Ndealers are adding another two thousand on
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.68,0:08:34.09,Doc,,0,0,0,,top but BYD hasn't confirmed that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.14,0:08:37.08,Doc,,0,0,0,,So if a dealer offers you six\Nthousand, get it in writing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.76,0:08:40.11,Doc,,0,0,0,,Number five: the Renault Duster.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.16,0:08:44.19,Doc,,0,0,0,,The Duster is a small, tough SUV, and\Nyou can get it with four-wheel drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.24,0:08:47.25,Doc,,0,0,0,,Now it's had up to five thousand\Ndollars cut from its price,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.30,0:08:48.79,Doc,,0,0,0,,according to Cars24,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.84,0:08:54.29,Doc,,0,0,0,,and the entry-level Evolution two-wheel\Ndrive is now $29,990 drive-away
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.34,0:08:55.41,Doc,,0,0,0,,nationwide.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.46,0:08:59.41,Doc,,0,0,0,,That's a real off-road-capable SUV\Nfor under thirty thousand dollars
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.46,0:08:59.83,Doc,,0,0,0,,drive-away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.88,0:09:03.41,Doc,,0,0,0,,The four-wheel-drive versions are around\Nthirty-four to thirty-six thousand
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.46,0:09:04.67,Doc,,0,0,0,,drive-away in New South Wales.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.72,0:09:08.81,Doc,,0,0,0,,The offer covers cars bought and delivered\Nbetween the 1st of November and the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.86,0:09:10.47,Doc,,0,0,0,,31st of December.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.52,0:09:11.39,Doc,,0,0,0,,Why the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.44,0:09:12.33,Doc,,0,0,0,,Renault didn't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.38,0:09:13.81,Doc,,0,0,0,,But the sales figures do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.86,0:09:18.43,Doc,,0,0,0,,In October, the whole Renault brand\Nsold just 164 cars in Australia,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.48,0:09:21.17,Doc,,0,0,0,,down 58 per cent on the\Nsame month last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.22,0:09:25.49,Doc,,0,0,0,,The Arkana sold four, the Koleos\N21, and the Kangoo van just two.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.54,0:09:26.19,Doc,,0,0,0,,The catch?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.24,0:09:28.39,Doc,,0,0,0,,The advertised price is\Nfor Solid White only.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.44,0:09:31.53,Doc,,0,0,0,,Any other colour adds $850.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.58,0:09:34.87,Doc,,0,0,0,,And fleet, government and rental\Nbuyers can't get the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.92,0:09:37.03,Doc,,0,0,0,,Also think about the brand's future here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.08,0:09:38.35,Doc,,0,0,0,,With sales this low,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.40,0:09:40.33,Doc,,0,0,0,,ask about the dealer network near you,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.38,0:09:43.08,Doc,,0,0,0,,servicing costs and parts\Nsupply before you sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.85,0:09:45.37,Doc,,0,0,0,,Number four: the Ford Ranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.42,0:09:47.88,Doc,,0,0,0,,This is Australia's\Nother favourite vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.93,0:09:50.86,Doc,,0,0,0,,The Ranger has been the best-selling\Nvehicle in the country for four months
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.91,0:09:51.58,Doc,,0,0,0,,this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.63,0:09:53.44,Doc,,0,0,0,,But it's in a fight with the HiLux,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.49,0:09:57.38,Doc,,0,0,0,,with BYD's Shark 6, and with\Na wave of new Chinese utes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.43,0:09:59.00,Doc,,0,0,0,,So according to CarExpert,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.05,0:10:02.52,Doc,,0,0,0,,Ford is offering a five-thousand-dollar\Nfuel card or a discount of the same
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.57,0:10:08.22,Doc,,0,0,0,,value on the 2026.5 model year\NRanger XLT, Wildtrak and Tremor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.27,0:10:11.30,Doc,,0,0,0,,For the newer 2027 versions\Nof the same models,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.35,0:10:13.30,Doc,,0,0,0,,the offer is four thousand dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.35,0:10:18.34,Doc,,0,0,0,,And the Ranger Black Edition V6 dual-cab\Npickup has a drive-away price of
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.39,0:10:19.40,Doc,,0,0,0,,$59,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.45,0:10:20.86,Doc,,0,0,0,,Here's the smart move.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.91,0:10:24.08,Doc,,0,0,0,,Ford's offer gives you a choice\Nbetween a fuel card and a discount.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.13,0:10:25.12,Doc,,0,0,0,,Take the discount.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.17,0:10:28.16,Doc,,0,0,0,,As I said earlier, a discount\Nreduces the price you pay,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.21,0:10:30.40,Doc,,0,0,0,,the amount you borrow and the stamp duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.45,0:10:32.10,Doc,,0,0,0,,A fuel card does none of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.15,0:10:32.82,Doc,,0,0,0,,The catch?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.87,0:10:35.66,Doc,,0,0,0,,CarExpert didn't publish an end\Ndate for these Ranger offers,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.71,0:10:37.36,Doc,,0,0,0,,so they could end at any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.41,0:10:40.44,Doc,,0,0,0,,And the five-thousand-dollar\Noffer is on the older model year.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.49,0:10:43.98,Doc,,0,0,0,,If you're buying to keep for a long\Ntime, the model year matters less.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.03,0:10:46.77,Doc,,0,0,0,,If you'll sell it in two or\Nthree years, it can matter more.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.25,0:10:49.72,Doc,,0,0,0,,Number three: Suzuki's Black Friday sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.77,0:10:53.98,Doc,,0,0,0,,Suzuki is running a Black Friday sale\Nwith ten per cent off the price of black
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.03,0:10:54.74,Doc,,0,0,0,,cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.79,0:10:56.92,Doc,,0,0,0,,Yes, it only applies to black cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.97,0:10:59.22,Doc,,0,0,0,,The biggest saving,\Naccording to CarExpert,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.27,0:11:02.70,Doc,,0,0,0,,is on the new e Vitara Ultra electric SUV:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.75,0:11:08.92,Doc,,0,0,0,,$5,774 off, bringing it\Nto $51,962 drive-away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.97,0:11:13.42,Doc,,0,0,0,,The e Vitara Motion is $42,862 drive-away,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.47,0:11:16.20,Doc,,0,0,0,,a saving of $4,874.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.25,0:11:21.18,Doc,,0,0,0,,The Vitara Turbo hybrid\Nis $36,762 drive-away,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.23,0:11:24.02,Doc,,0,0,0,,saving $3,974.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.07,0:11:26.78,Doc,,0,0,0,,And here's the one that'll\Nget attention: the Jimny.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.83,0:11:31.58,Doc,,0,0,0,,The three-door Jimny in\Nblack is $35,762 drive-away,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.63,0:11:34.48,Doc,,0,0,0,,a saving of $3,474.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.53,0:11:39.48,Doc,,0,0,0,,The five-door Jimny XL\Nis $37,562 drive-away,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.53,0:11:42.06,Doc,,0,0,0,,saving $3,674.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.11,0:11:45.96,Doc,,0,0,0,,The Swift Hybrid starts\Nat $23,022 drive-away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.01,0:11:47.84,Doc,,0,0,0,,The catches are important on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.89,0:11:49.40,Doc,,0,0,0,,It's for private buyers only.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.45,0:11:52.68,Doc,,0,0,0,,You have to buy and take\Ndelivery by the 30th of November.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.73,0:11:56.73,Doc,,0,0,0,,It only covers selected new and\Ndemonstrator stock at participating dealers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.78,0:12:00.30,Doc,,0,0,0,,Cars with a black roof and a\Ndifferent body colour don't count,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.35,0:12:03.88,Doc,,0,0,0,,the Jimny Heritage isn't included\Nand the offer excludes Queensland and
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.93,0:12:05.34,Doc,,0,0,0,,northern New South Wales.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.39,0:12:07.07,Doc,,0,0,0,,So if you're in Brisbane, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.74,0:12:11.09,Doc,,0,0,0,,Number two: the cheapest\Nnew car in Australia.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.14,0:12:16.41,Doc,,0,0,0,,The BYD Atto 1 Essential\Nis now $19,990 drive-away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.46,0:12:17.23,Doc,,0,0,0,,That's a brand-new,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.28,0:12:21.40,Doc,,0,0,0,,fully electric small car for under\Ntwenty thousand dollars, on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.45,0:12:24.23,Doc,,0,0,0,,Zecar describes it as\NAustralia's cheapest new car,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.28,0:12:30.39,Doc,,0,0,0,,and says the saving is\Nbetween $5,772 and $7,204,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.44,0:12:32.05,Doc,,0,0,0,,depending on your state.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.10,0:12:34.57,Doc,,0,0,0,,The offer runs for orders\Nuntil the 15th of December,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.62,0:12:37.47,Doc,,0,0,0,,with delivery by the 31st of December.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.52,0:12:42.61,Doc,,0,0,0,,BYD is also offering the Dolphin\NEssential electric hatch at $28,888
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.66,0:12:48.79,Doc,,0,0,0,,drive-away, and the Atto 2 plug-in\Nhybrid at $25,990 drive-away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.84,0:12:50.25,Doc,,0,0,0,,Think about what that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.30,0:12:54.59,Doc,,0,0,0,,For years, the cheapest new cars in\NAustralia were small petrol hatchbacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.64,0:12:55.87,Doc,,0,0,0,,Now, according to Zecar,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.92,0:12:59.97,Doc,,0,0,0,,the cheapest new car you can buy is\Nelectric, and it's made in China.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.02,0:13:00.71,Doc,,0,0,0,,The catch?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.76,0:13:02.89,Doc,,0,0,0,,The Atto 1 is a small city car.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.94,0:13:03.97,Doc,,0,0,0,,It's not a family SUV,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.02,0:13:08.49,Doc,,0,0,0,,and its range and space are built for\Nthe city, not for long country drives.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.54,0:13:12.25,Doc,,0,0,0,,If most of your driving is in town,\Nit could save you a fortune in fuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.30,0:13:15.21,Doc,,0,0,0,,If you regularly drive hundreds\Nof kilometres in one go,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.26,0:13:17.00,Doc,,0,0,0,,test it properly before you sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.75,0:13:20.08,Doc,,0,0,0,,And number one: the Kia Tasman.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.13,0:13:22.22,Doc,,0,0,0,,The Tasman is Kia's first-ever ute,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.27,0:13:24.12,Doc,,0,0,0,,and it was developed\Nwith Australia in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.17,0:13:25.50,Doc,,0,0,0,,Before it launched,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.55,0:13:28.68,Doc,,0,0,0,,Kia was talking about twenty\Nthousand sales in its first year.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.73,0:13:30.56,Doc,,0,0,0,,But according to the\Nofficial VFACTS figures,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.61,0:13:32.32,Doc,,0,0,0,,reported by GoAuto,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.37,0:13:38.58,Doc,,0,0,0,,Kia had sold 7,898 Tasmans from its\Nlaunch in July 2025 to the end of
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.63,0:13:40.22,Doc,,0,0,0,,September 2026.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.27,0:13:43.68,Doc,,0,0,0,,That's fifteen months, and not\Neven half the first-year target.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.73,0:13:45.78,Doc,,0,0,0,,Kia's own global planning boss said:
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.83,0:13:49.14,Doc,,0,0,0,,"Clearly we are not satisfied\Nyet." So now Kia is cutting hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.19,0:13:52.09,Doc,,0,0,0,,According to a report published\Non the 4th of November,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.14,0:13:58.92,Doc,,0,0,0,,the 2025-model Tasman SX four-wheel\Ndrive is now $49,990 drive-away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.97,0:14:03.94,Doc,,0,0,0,,Its list price was $54,490\Nbefore on-road costs,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.99,0:14:05.98,Doc,,0,0,0,,so that's around five\Nthousand dollars off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.03,0:14:11.48,Doc,,0,0,0,,And the Tasman SX+ four-wheel\Ndrive is now $54,990 drive-away,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.53,0:14:16.10,Doc,,0,0,0,,down from $62,390 before on-road costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.15,0:14:19.08,Doc,,0,0,0,,Once you add in the on-road\Ncosts you'd normally pay,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.13,0:14:21.32,Doc,,0,0,0,,that's a saving of more\Nthan ten thousand dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.37,0:14:25.40,Doc,,0,0,0,,ABN holders can also get five thousand\Ndollars off single and dual cab-chassis
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.45,0:14:28.26,Doc,,0,0,0,,S and SX models with an alloy tray.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.31,0:14:29.02,Doc,,0,0,0,,The catch?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.07,0:14:31.88,Doc,,0,0,0,,The deal is only on 2025 model-year cars,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.93,0:14:34.50,Doc,,0,0,0,,and you have to order and\Ntake delivery in November.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.55,0:14:35.92,Doc,,0,0,0,,So stock is limited.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.97,0:14:38.90,Doc,,0,0,0,,And with sales this low,\Nthink about resale value.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.95,0:14:42.36,Doc,,0,0,0,,A ute with a small fan base is\Nharder to sell in a few years' time,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.41,0:14:45.68,Doc,,0,0,0,,so plan to keep it for a while or make\Nsure the discount is big enough to
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.73,0:14:47.15,Doc,,0,0,0,,cover the extra depreciation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.12,0:14:50.07,Doc,,0,0,0,,Before we finish, a bonus.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.12,0:14:53.26,Doc,,0,0,0,,This isn't a runout deal, but it's\Nthe biggest price cut I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.31,0:14:58.75,Doc,,0,0,0,,Audi has cut the price of the updated\NQ4 e-tron electric SUV by up to eighteen
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.80,0:14:59.53,Doc,,0,0,0,,thousand dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.58,0:15:01.31,Doc,,0,0,0,,According to Cars24,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.36,0:15:06.51,Doc,,0,0,0,,the entry models are now\N$71,650 before on-road costs,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.56,0:15:08.45,Doc,,0,0,0,,about thirteen thousand dollars cheaper,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.50,0:15:11.75,Doc,,0,0,0,,and the all-wheel-drive quattro versions\Nare up to eighteen thousand dollars
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.80,0:15:12.71,Doc,,0,0,0,,cheaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.76,0:15:15.69,Doc,,0,0,0,,That brings them well under\Nthe luxury car tax threshold.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.74,0:15:16.31,Doc,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.36,0:15:20.73,Doc,,0,0,0,,Because the current Q4 e-tron sold\Njust two cars in Australia in October,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.78,0:15:22.01,Doc,,0,0,0,,down 96 per cent.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.06,0:15:26.11,Doc,,0,0,0,,The catch is that deliveries of the\Nupdated model don't start until the first
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.16,0:15:27.64,Doc,,0,0,0,,half of 2027.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.48,0:15:30.61,Doc,,0,0,0,,So how do you get the\Nbest out of these deals?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.66,0:15:32.55,Doc,,0,0,0,,First, read the fine print.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.60,0:15:34.81,Doc,,0,0,0,,Look for words like "private buyers only",
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.86,0:15:37.31,Doc,,0,0,0,,"selected stock", "participating dealers",
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.36,0:15:40.55,Doc,,0,0,0,,"not combinable with other offers"\Nand "must be delivered by".
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.60,0:15:43.31,Doc,,0,0,0,,Most of these deals end\Non the 30th of November,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.36,0:15:46.61,Doc,,0,0,0,,the 21st of December or\Nthe 31st of December.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.66,0:15:51.33,Doc,,0,0,0,,Second, always ask for a final drive-away\Nprice in writing, for your postcode.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.38,0:15:53.53,Doc,,0,0,0,,Advertised prices can change by state.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.58,0:15:57.39,Doc,,0,0,0,,Third, prefer a real discount\Nover a fuel card or a gift card.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.44,0:16:00.57,Doc,,0,0,0,,A discount reduces what you\Nborrow and the stamp duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.62,0:16:02.91,Doc,,0,0,0,,Fourth, if a deal depends on finance,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.96,0:16:07.25,Doc,,0,0,0,,compare the interest rate and the total\Ncost of the loan, not just the bonus.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.30,0:16:09.41,Doc,,0,0,0,,Fifth, ask about demonstrators.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.46,0:16:12.85,Doc,,0,0,0,,Several of these deals, like\NSuzuki's, include demo stock.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.90,0:16:16.01,Doc,,0,0,0,,A demonstrator with a few thousand\Nkilometres can take another chunk off the
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.06,0:16:19.93,Doc,,0,0,0,,price, and it's usually still covered\Nby most of the new-car warranty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.98,0:16:21.29,Doc,,0,0,0,,Just check the build date,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.34,0:16:22.63,Doc,,0,0,0,,the date the warranty started,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.68,0:16:26.23,Doc,,0,0,0,,and the service history, and make\Nsure the price reflects any wear.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.28,0:16:27.87,Doc,,0,0,0,,Sixth, timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.92,0:16:29.15,Doc,,0,0,0,,The last week of a month,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.20,0:16:31.03,Doc,,0,0,0,,and especially the last weeks of December,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.08,0:16:33.87,Doc,,0,0,0,,is when dealers are most\Ndesperate to hit their targets.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.92,0:16:36.09,Doc,,0,0,0,,If a deal ends on the 30th of November,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.14,0:16:39.21,Doc,,0,0,0,,don't be surprised if a new one\Nstarts on the 1st of December.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.26,0:16:43.03,Doc,,0,0,0,,But don't wait too long on limited\Nstock once the cheap cars are gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.08,0:16:43.81,Doc,,0,0,0,,they're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.86,0:16:45.91,Doc,,0,0,0,,And finally, think about resale.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.96,0:16:48.89,Doc,,0,0,0,,The biggest discounts are usually\Non the cars that aren't selling.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.94,0:16:50.75,Doc,,0,0,0,,That's great for the price you pay today,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.80,0:16:52.79,Doc,,0,0,0,,but it can mean faster depreciation later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.84,0:16:53.90,Doc,,0,0,0,,So that's the list:
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.95,0:16:56.33,Doc,,0,0,0,,Chery and Mitsubishi's fuel cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.38,0:16:59.85,Doc,,0,0,0,,Honda's gift cards, GWM, the Toyota HiLux,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.90,0:17:02.33,Doc,,0,0,0,,BYD's cashback, the Renault Duster,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.38,0:17:05.21,Doc,,0,0,0,,the Ford Ranger, Suzuki's\NBlack Friday sale,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.26,0:17:09.11,Doc,,0,0,0,,the BYD Atto 1 under twenty\Nthousand dollars and at number one,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.16,0:17:12.11,Doc,,0,0,0,,the Kia Tasman, with more\Nthan ten thousand dollars off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.16,0:17:15.39,Doc,,0,0,0,,Now tell me in the comments: which of\Nthese deals would you actually take?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.44,0:17:17.75,Doc,,0,0,0,,And if you've been offered a\Nbetter deal at a dealership,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.80,0:17:20.23,Doc,,0,0,0,,share it below, because\Nit'll help other buyers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.28,0:17:21.29,Doc,,0,0,0,,If this video helped,
